<title>INDIA: Funds push Delhi shares to stronger close.</title>
<headline>Funds push Delhi shares to stronger close.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brisk buying in steel, cement and banking shares by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) and local mutual funds pushed the Delhi bourse to a moderately higher close, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi stock exchange index ended 3.21 points higher at 802.93.</p>
